                    "#Choose your mason jars depending on how big you want the light to be. You can find vintage mason jars at antique stores or find canning jars online or in kitchen supply stores. In some locations, they sell canning jars by the dozen at supermarkets. Canning jars come in varying sizes, including 8 oz., {{convert|1|USpt|ml|adj=on|round=1}} and 1 quart. The bigger the jar, the bigger your bulb can be and the brighter the light.[[Image:Make Mason Jar Lights Step 1 Version 4.jpg|center]]"
                ],
